Thought: Test a robust deterministic approach on the strongest pool: median over pool1 to see if median beats mean pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with the strong THETA model to see if a single model beats the pool combinations.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the full pool to see if trimming improves the strong baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Evaluate a robust median over pool2 to see if shifting pool improves over mean pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the larger pool3 to see if including ETS improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Evaluate a DTW barycenter on the strongest pool (pool1) to see if a non-deterministic approach beats mean pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter on pool2 to see if adding the DWT_rf model improves over pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test weighted ensemble using the existing w1 handle on pool1 to see if a learned weighting improves over the best dba pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["THETA","rf","catboost","CWT_catboost","FT_catboost"],"weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if it improves on weighted w2 or is competitive.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a robust median ensemble on pool4 to see if it outperforms the current mean/weighted leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean ensemble on pool4 with a moderate trim to see if robustness improves over mean/median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy using the top model (rf) to see if a single model outperforms the current ensemble.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

